.DS_Store
*.part
# 1.13 (D6): atomic part files now KEEP the real extension ("x.part.mov", never
# "x.mov.part") so a kept artifact stays openable by the extension-keyed macOS
# tools — which means the bare `*.part` pattern above no longer matches them.
*.part.*
*.premeta.*
*.autobest.*
*.mov
*.mp4
!examples/**/*.mov
